Source: wildos-zlib-ng
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Wild OS Developers <dev@wildos.io>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: wildos-zlib-ng
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, zlib1g
Description: Faster zlib for Wild OS (zlib-ng in zlib-compatible mode)
 zlib-ng 2.3.3 built as a drop-in libz.so.1, about twice as fast as zlib at
 packing and unpacking. It lives in a directory of its own, ahead of the
 system's zlib in the loader's search order, and never replaces a file of
 zlib1g. A check runs whenever zlib1g changes: if the system's zlib is ever
 newer than the one this build stands in for, or the build fails its own
 test, the loader goes back to the system's zlib until an update fits again.
